## Boundaries

- Sample-data demonstrations, synthetic narration; native setup instructions are not live execution.
- Current-source Previous answer is absent from the unchanged published installer.
- No capture-compatibility, universal invisibility or live meeting/provider claims.
- Website-only behavior change, no native UI/source or installer update.
